     read-only constant or in-kernel variable whose type matches the type of
     the node's value.  For example, SSYYSSCCTTLL__IINNTT() reports the raw value of an
     associated variable of type _i_n_t.  However, nodes may also export a value
     that is a translation of an internal representation.

