     SSYYSSCCTTLL__AADDDD__PPRROOCC() to export a millisecond time interval.  When using this
     handler, the _a_r_g_2 parameter points to an in-kernel variable of type _i_n_t
     which stores a tick count suitable for use with functions like tsleep(9).
     The ssyyssccttll__mmsseecc__ttoo__ttiicckkss() function converts this value to milliseconds
     when reporting the node's value.  Similarly, ssyyssccttll__mmsseecc__ttoo__ttiicckkss() ac‐
     cepts new values in milliseconds and stores an equivalent value in ticks
     to _*_a_r_g_2.  Note that new code should use kernel variables of type
     _s_b_i_n_t_i_m_e___t instead of tick counts.

